    IDS_MSG_21623    "A demon materializes, takes a quick look at the corpse,"
    IDS_MSG_21624    "and teleports away with a faint popping noise."
    IDS_MSG_21625    "A sports columnist rushes forward and takes a quick photo"
    IDS_MSG_21626    "of the corpse and rushes off muttering about a deadline."
    IDS_MSG_21627    "You hear a fanfare in the distance, and feel dismayed."
    IDS_MSG_21628    "You feel smug."
    IDS_MSG_21629    "You feel ashamed."
    IDS_MSG_21630    "In the distance you hear a trumpet. A Servant of Law"
    IDS_MSG_21631    "materializes, sheds a tear, picks up the badge, and leaves."
    IDS_MSG_21632    "materializes, sheds a tear, and leaves."
    IDS_MSG_21633    "A new justiciar has been promoted!"
    IDS_MSG_21634    "A Servant of Chaos materializes, grabs the corpse,"
    IDS_MSG_21635    "snickers a bit, and vanishes."
    IDS_MSG_21636    "You seem to hear a woman's voice from far off:"
    IDS_MSG_21637    "'Well done! Come to me now....'"
    IDS_MSG_21638    "A female voice sounds from just behind your ear:"
    IDS_MSG_21639    "'Well fought! I have some new advice for you....'"
