    IDS_MSG_21648    "A bolt of godsfire strikes the monster...."
    IDS_MSG_21649    "The deity of the altar smiles on the monster...."
    IDS_MSG_21650    "A shaft of light zaps the altar..."
    IDS_MSG_21651    "but nothing much seems to happen"
END

