    IDS_MSG_21809    "A stern voice thunders in the air around you:"
    IDS_MSG_21810    "'No unbelievers may enter these sacred precincts;"
    IDS_MSG_21811    "those who defile this shrine will be destroyed!"
    IDS_MSG_21812    "You have come upon a huge ornately appointed throne!"
    IDS_MSG_21813    "Sit in it? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21814    "The throne emits an eerie violet-black radiance."
    IDS_MSG_21815    "You find, to your horror, that you cannot get up!"
    IDS_MSG_21816    "You feel an abstract sucking sensation..."
    IDS_MSG_21817    "The radiance finally ceases. You can get up now."
    IDS_MSG_21818    "You hear the sound of a magic kazoo played by an asthmatic."
    IDS_MSG_21819    "Following some strange impulse, you raise the Sceptre...."
    IDS_MSG_21820    "You hear a magical fanfare, repeated three times."
    IDS_MSG_21821    "Strength."
    IDS_MSG_21822    "Constitution."
    IDS_MSG_21823    "Dexterity."
    IDS_MSG_21824    "Agility."
    IDS_MSG_21825    "Intelligence."
    IDS_MSG_21826    "Power."
    IDS_MSG_21827    "A mysterious voice mutters peevishly...."
    IDS_MSG_21828    "So what do you want now? A medal?"
    IDS_MSG_21829    "Mystic runes appear in the air before you:"
    IDS_MSG_21830    "They appear to describe some high-powered spell."
    IDS_MSG_21831    "You hear a distant voice...."
    IDS_MSG_21832    "'You may now tread the path of High Magic.'"
    IDS_MSG_21833    "Weird flickering lights play over the throne."
    IDS_MSG_21834    "You hear a strange droning sound, as of a magical"
    IDS_MSG_21835    "artifact stressed by excessive use...."
    IDS_MSG_21836    "With an odd tinkling sound the throne shatters!"
    IDS_MSG_21837    "Your sceptre reverberates with the noise, and"
    IDS_MSG_21838    "it too explodes in a spray of shards."
    IDS_MSG_21839    "You have found an extremely long stairway going straight up."
    IDS_MSG_21840    "The stairs are grilled steel and the bannister is rubber."
    IDS_MSG_21841    "Take the stairway? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21842    "The stairs suddenly start moving with a grind of gears!"
    IDS_MSG_21843    "You are wafted to the surface...."
    IDS_MSG_21844    "You have found a magical portal! Enter it? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21845    "A dulcet voice says: 'Jolly good show!'"
    IDS_MSG_21846    "This is a menhir carved of black marble with veins of gold."
    IDS_MSG_21847    "It emanates an aura of raw chaos, which is not terribly"
    IDS_MSG_21848    "surprising, considering its location."
    IDS_MSG_21849    "You feel an almost unbearable attraction to the stone."
    IDS_MSG_21850    "You find it extremely difficult to approach the stone."
    IDS_MSG_21851    "Touch it? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21852    "A sudden flux of energy surrounds you!"
    IDS_MSG_21853    "You feel stronger!"
    IDS_MSG_21854    "You step back from the ominous dolmech."
    IDS_MSG_21855    "This is a massive granite slab teetering dangerously on a corner."
    IDS_MSG_21856    "You feel a sense of balance as you regard it."
    IDS_MSG_21857    "A vortex of mana spins about you!"
    IDS_MSG_21858    "The cyclone whirls you off to a strange place!"
    IDS_MSG_21859    "You are being drained of experience! Step back? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21860    "The vortex calms down, dimishes, and then disappears."
    IDS_MSG_21861    "The vortex vanishes. Suddenly, there is a clap of thunder!"
    IDS_MSG_21862    "You step back from the unlikely boulder."
    IDS_MSG_21863    "This is a stele carved of blueish-green feldspar."
    IDS_MSG_21864    "You feel an aura of serenity rising from it, and your gaze"
    IDS_MSG_21865    "is attracted to the bulk of Star Peak to the North-East."
    IDS_MSG_21866    "You feel a subtle attraction to the stone."
    IDS_MSG_21867    "You find the stone extremely distasteful to contemplate."
    IDS_MSG_21868    "A matrix of power flows about you!"
    IDS_MSG_21869    "You feel more vigorous!"
    IDS_MSG_21870    "You step back from the strange obelisk."
    IDS_MSG_21871    "This is a grey and uninteresting stone."
    IDS_MSG_21872    "A feeling of nihility emanates from it."
    IDS_MSG_21873    "You feel negated."
    IDS_MSG_21874    "You back away from the strange rock."
    IDS_MSG_21875    "You have come on a weathered basaltic block."
    IDS_MSG_21876    "On the top surface is an indentation in human shape."
    IDS_MSG_21877    "You see old rust colored stains in the grain of the stone."
    IDS_MSG_21878    "You sense something awakening. Touch the block? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21879    "You sense great pain emanating from the ancient altar."
    IDS_MSG_21880    "Climb on to the block? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21881    "You are stuck fast to the block!"
    IDS_MSG_21882    "You feel your life-force being sucked away!"
    IDS_MSG_21883    "Hit ESCAPE to try and get up at any moment, SPACE to remain."
    IDS_MSG_21884    "You feel weaker."
    IDS_MSG_21885    "You feel your life fading."
    IDS_MSG_21886    "Your energy is vanishing."
    IDS_MSG_21887    "You are being drained."
    IDS_MSG_21888    "You manage to wrench yourself off the ancient altar!"
    IDS_MSG_21889    "You leave some skin behind, though...."
    IDS_MSG_21890    "A strange red glow arises from the altar."
    IDS_MSG_21891    "The glow surrounds you.... You sense gratitude."
    IDS_MSG_21892    "You a have a sense of rejection."
    IDS_MSG_21893    "A roil of fetid vapor smokes up from the altar."
    IDS_MSG_21894    "You sense an emotion of pique all around you."
    IDS_MSG_21895    "You retreat from the strange stone."
    IDS_MSG_21896    "You decide discretion to be the better part of valour."
    IDS_MSG_21897    "The stone seems to subside sleepily."
    IDS_MSG_21898    "You approach a giant crystal of some opaline material."
    IDS_MSG_21899    "Flashes of irridescent light glint from the object."
    IDS_MSG_21900    "You feel your attention being drawn by the intricate crystal."
    IDS_MSG_21901    "Look away from the interesting phenomenon? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21902    "Your gaze focuses deeply on the gem...."
    IDS_MSG_21903    "The crystal seems to open up and surround you!"
    IDS_MSG_21904    "Your mind has been enhanced by the experience!"
    IDS_MSG_21905    "You manage to wrench your gaze from the odd jewel."
    IDS_MSG_21906    "The light flashes from the crystal diminish in frequency."
END

