    IDS_MSG_21961    "The coils squeeze tighter and tighter..."
    IDS_MSG_21962    "The dragonlord hurls you to the ground!"
    IDS_MSG_21963    "You are awestruck at the sight of the Dragonlord."
    IDS_MSG_21964    "You are extremely impressed at the sight of the Dragonlord."
