    IDS_MSG_22103    "The Prime makes an intricate gesture, which leaves behind"
    IDS_MSG_22104    "glowing blue sparks... He winks mischievously at you...."
    IDS_MSG_22105    "The blue sparks strike you! You feel enhanced!"
