    IDS_MSG_22422    "You feel insubstantial hands closing around your throat...."
    IDS_MSG_22423    "You feel your life draining away!"
    IDS_MSG_22424    "You are finally released, a husk of your former self...."
    IDS_MSG_22425    "Luckily for you, a smooth-tongued advocate from the"
    IDS_MSG_22426    "Rampart Chaotic Liberties Union gets you off!"
